# #100 item 8: 1-D list add with unequal lengths — the VM's tensor_elementwise
# truncates to the shorter operand; the old AOT read past the shorter buffer
# (OOB heap read, printed garbage).
policy is {"b1": [10.0, 20.0]}
obs is [1.0, 1.0, 1.0]
define forward(policy, obs) as:
    h1 is add of [obs, policy.b1]
    return h1
print of (forward of [policy, obs])
